WEBVTT

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:34.513
It takes me back to the summer of 2011.

00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:36.602
My family, my kids had all grown up.

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.228
We were officially empty nesters,

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:41.199
and we decided, let's 
go on a family vacation.

00:00:41.199 --> 00:00:43.306
Jenn, my daughter, and my son-in-law

00:00:43.306 --> 00:00:44.880
came down from New York.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.342
My youngest, Andrew,

00:00:46.342 --> 00:00:48.897
he came down from his home in Charlestown

00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:50.675
where he was working in Boston,

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:51.916
and my son Pete,

00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:54.858
who had played at 
Boston College, baseball,

00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:57.682
had played baseball 
professionally in Europe,

00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:02.559
and had now come home and was selling
group insurance, he also joined us.